{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/3894142e989cddeb1bc94431ab6a5ea3.avif?t=1767207173\" width=1600 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your teacher, Ms. Morbid, has trapped you and your classmates on a deadly field trip inside a human body. Split into two teams, you must scavenge, sabotage, and race to see which classmates escape first, all while avoiding and exploiting the quirks of the human body: stomach acid, viruses, and even the cheeseburger the host just swallowed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, scheme, and shout in real time with proximity chat as you hear teammates and rivals only when they\u2019re close enough to you. Eavesdrop on enemy plans, disguise yourself as the other team and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORING THE HUMAN BODY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/97aa67696599320ea97c59b0522e7fee.poster.avif?t=1767207173\" width=1000 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/97aa67696599320ea97c59b0522e7fee.webm?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/97aa67696599320ea97c59b0522e7fee.mp4?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Navigate deadly obstacles inside the human body, scavenge resources, and race to repair your Magic Van before the rival team escapes! Each match features random twists, the human might be sick, flooding the map with germs, or have hiccups that jolt the world up and down, plus many more surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADING AND REPAIRING THE MAGIC VAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/5c794cca352f75aa7cfcbf854bac5fb6.poster.avif?t=1767207173\" width=1000 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/5c794cca352f75aa7cfcbf854bac5fb6.webm?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/5c794cca352f75aa7cfcbf854bac5fb6.mp4?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and repair your Magic Van to get ahead of the rival team! Boost its speed, reinforce its armor, and load it with features to outwit, outmaneuver, and crush the opposite class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EQUIP YOURSELF! AND SCOOTERS!!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/a8ec75f182f73e2a2b45bd4e0471cb2e.poster.avif?t=1767207173\" width=1000 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/a8ec75f182f73e2a2b45bd4e0471cb2e.webm?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/a8ec75f182f73e2a2b45bd4e0471cb2e.mp4?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down lunch boxes hidden across the classroom and deep inside the human body, find weapons, health packs, and SCOOTERS to aid your class in victory! SCOOTERS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MS.MORBID</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/4ed1027e6b2e6ae54994173462a72002.poster.avif?t=1767207173\" width=1000 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/4ed1027e6b2e6ae54994173462a72002.webm?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/extras/4ed1027e6b2e6ae54994173462a72002.mp4?t=1767207173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Ms.Morbid or she will eat you! Quirky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Player Lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did we Mention Scooters?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404880?t=1767207173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/c61e6a492cbec2a66a50a00625d07130e60423f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767207173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/b3614c4f9dd0fc27e66857f0e995126e72b019fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767207173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404880/b3614c4f9dd0fc27e66857f0e995126e72b019fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767207173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9}